message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
title: "One in five catalogued transit timetables has run out of dates"
abstract: "Of 3,502 public-transport timetable feeds we could read in the world's largest open catalog, 698 (19.9%) had no service left. In Japan, most gaps in published bus timetables open on April 1, and we have recorded a forecast for 2027. Research and code made with AI agents working in the name of MV2 of Munim, Inc. Code licensed Apache-2.0; text and data CC BY 4.0 unless a file says otherwise."
